@node hiss-reducer Plugin Parameters
@section Parameters

This plugin has no user-tunable parameters.


@strong{Structural parameters} (Low Latency) require rebuilding the plugin when changed. Other parameters update in real-time with zero dropout.

@node hiss-reducer Plugin Developer Guide
@section Developer Guide

SOTF hiss reducer plugin — stationary high-frequency noise reduction.

Wraps the @code{HissReducer} block from @code{plugins-denoiser} in the SOTF host plugin trait.

@subsubheading Parameter wiring

All parameters reach the audio thread through the host's @code{rebuild_cached_parameters} / @code{set_parameter} / @code{get_parameter} triad. Structural parameters (marked in the notes below) trigger a rebuild; the rest update in real time with zero dropouts.

